WEBVTT

00:21:59.163 --> 00:22:01.829
Bring up a point of view, bring
a lot of curiosity,

00:22:01.829 --> 00:22:06.996
be prepared to listen more than you talk
and be prepared from for some discomfort,

00:22:06.996 --> 00:22:09.871
because we're going to stay in this until
we understand each other better.

00:22:10.121 --> 00:22:12.704
And so it's just an attention set up
for us. We're going to rumble.

00:22:13.121 --> 00:22:15.913
And so we have these rumble starters

00:22:15.913 --> 00:22:19.871
and language that we give people who
go through our training where.

00:22:21.454 --> 00:22:26.288
If I again, if I'm talking to you and we
have different takes on, you know,

00:22:26.538 --> 00:22:30.788
the perks of vulnerability, I'm just
practicing my work with you.